{
    "title": "Factor_ Prepared Meal Delivery",
    "description": "Factor's prepared meal delivery makes eating well easy!\r\n\r\nOur nutritious meal plans offer 29+ meals and recipes every week from a rotating menu that feature options from Keto, Vegan, Vegetarian, low-carb, and low-calorie diets. You can also add snacks, drinks and other wholesome add-ons to your food delivery order.\r\n\r\nSo, what sets Factor apart from other meal kit delivery options?\r\n\r\n<b>Pre-Made Meals Are Ready to Eat in Minutes</b>\r\nForget about searching for healthy recipes that fit your diet. Our food delivery service sends prepared meals straight to your doorstep so you can spend less time prepping, cooking, and cleaning and more time savoring nutritious meals.\r\n\r\n<b>Dietitian-Approved Recipes That Use Top Ingredients</b>\r\nAll of our recipes are designed by dietitians who specialize in healthy eating and are crafted by chefs who make sure our meal plans only use the highest quality, freshest ingredients available. You can rest easy knowing that every premade meal you receive from Factor will take you one step closer to a healthier lifestyle.\r\n\r\n<b>Special Diets Made Simple</b>\r\nWhether you're an omnivore or follow a plant-based diet, the Factor app offers ready to eat meals for the most popular diet plans, including:\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd69 Keto Diet\r\n\ud83e\udd66 Vegan Diet\r\n\ud83e\udd6c Vegetarian Diet\r\n\ud83d\udcaa Low Calorie Diet\r\n\ud83e\udd57 Low Carb Diet\r\n\r\n<b>_Flexibility in Every Meal Plan_</b>\r\nChoose from a variety of dietitian-approved meal plans ranging from 4 to 18 meals per week. Each plan is delivered every week directly to your door, and can be modified in case you're heading out of town for a couple of days, or need extra meals for the weeks when you're just too busy to cook.\r\n \r\n<b>A Meal Plan Personalized For You</b>\r\nThe Factor food delivery app provides meals that fit all tastes and preferences. When you make choices to your meal plans, our app will personalize future weekly meal selections to keep you diet fun and exciting.\r\n\r\n<b>Our Customer Service Team is Here to Support Your Goals for Healthier Eating</b>\r\nOur customer experience team is always available to help answer questions and ensure you're fully enjoying your meal plan! Contact us directly through your Factor app, call us at (888) 573-5727, or email us at help@factor75.com for assistance.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Factor&#39;s prepared meal delivery makes eating well easy!<br><br>Our nutritious meal plans offer 29+ meals and recipes every week from a rotating menu that feature options from Keto, Vegan, Vegetarian, low-carb, and low-calorie diets. You can also add snacks, drinks and other wholesome add-ons to your food delivery order.<br><br>So, what sets Factor apart from other meal kit delivery options?<br><br><b>Pre-Made Meals Are Ready to Eat in Minutes</b><br>Forget about searching for healthy recipes that fit your diet. Our food delivery service sends prepared meals straight to your doorstep so you can spend less time prepping, cooking, and cleaning and more time savoring nutritious meals.<br><br><b>Dietitian-Approved Recipes That Use Top Ingredients</b><br>All of our recipes are designed by dietitians who specialize in healthy eating and are crafted by chefs who make sure our meal plans only use the highest quality, freshest ingredients available. You can rest easy knowing that every premade meal you receive from Factor will take you one step closer to a healthier lifestyle.<br><br><b>Special Diets Made Simple</b><br>Whether you&#39;re an omnivore or follow a plant-based diet, the Factor app offers ready to eat meals for the most popular diet plans, including:<br><br>\ud83e\udd69 Keto Diet<br>\ud83e\udd66 Vegan Diet<br>\ud83e\udd6c Vegetarian Diet<br>\ud83d\udcaa Low Calorie Diet<br>\ud83e\udd57 Low Carb Diet<br><br><b>_Flexibility in Every Meal Plan_</b><br>Choose from a variety of dietitian-approved meal plans ranging from 4 to 18 meals per week. Each plan is delivered every week directly to your door, and can be modified in case you&#39;re heading out of town for a couple of days, or need extra meals for the weeks when you&#39;re just too busy to cook.<br> <br><b>A Meal Plan Personalized For You</b><br>The Factor food delivery app provides meals that fit all tastes and preferences. When you make choices to your meal plans, our app will personalize future weekly meal selections to keep you diet fun and exciting.<br><br><b>Our Customer Service Team is Here to Support Your Goals for Healthier Eating</b><br>Our customer experience team is always available to help answer questions and ensure you&#39;re fully enjoying your meal plan! Contact us directly through your Factor app, call us at (888) 573-5727, or email us at help@factor75.com for assistance.",
